{"title":"Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eEverything You Need to Know About Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAt King of Christmas, our collection of pre-lit artificial Christmas trees combines quality foliage, durable construction, and professionally installed lighting to create a stunning centerpiece for your home. With lights meticulously spaced throughout the branches, these trees eliminate the hassle of untangling strands or wrapping lights each year. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAvailable in a variety of heights and silhouettes, from full, traditional shapes to slim, space-saving designs, our pre-lit Christmas trees make it easy to find the perfect fit for your space. Simply assemble your tree, shape the branches, and enjoy a beautifully illuminated display in minutes.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our collection of pre-lit artificial Christmas trees to discover a convenient, high-quality option designed for effortless holiday decorating.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose a King of Christmas pre-lit Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eA pre-lit Christmas tree offers effortless convenience with professionally installed lights designed for even coverage and long-lasting performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas trees feature our integrated Power Pole system, allowing each section of the tree to connect automatically through the center pole. This eliminates the need to plug in multiple sections. Just stack the tree, plug in the base, and your tree lights up instantly. No complicated connections required. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eCompared to \u003ca title=\"Unlit Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/unlit-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eunlit artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, pre-lit Christmas trees offer a faster setup and more consistent lighting, making them a popular choice for those looking for convenience without sacrificing a beautifully decorated look.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas pre-lit artificial Christmas trees ship free to your door anywhere in the contiguous USA. Plus, with our 2-year warranty, you can shop with confidence knowing your tree is covered for many seasons of holiday magic. Exclusions apply — final sale and clearance items are covered by a 90-day warranty. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eHow long do the pre-lit Christmas tree lights last? \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eEach King of Christmas pre-lit tree is strung with high-quality micro LED lights that provide a consistent, vibrant glow. These energy-efficient lights are built to last over 25,000 hours, ensuring your tree shines beautifully for many holiday seasons. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhich pre-lit Christmas tree is best for my home?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe best pre-lit artificial Christmas tree depends on your space, style preferences, and lighting features. All King of Christmas pre-lit artificial Christmas trees feature warm white micro LED lights that create a classic holiday glow, along with a remote to control your lighting functions. For added versatility, we also offer \u003ca title=\"Multicolor Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/multicolor-pre-lit-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarm White and Multi-Color pre-lit trees\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, which allow you to choose between warm white or festive light settings.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFor enhanced lighting effects, our \u003ca title=\"Silverpeak Fir Artificial Christmas Tree\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/silverpeak-fir-trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSilverpeak Fir\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e features premium options with clustered twinkle lights, offering up to 10 different lighting functions including a vintage pastel multicolor for a customizable holiday display.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat light functions do King of Christmas pre-lit trees offer? \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas pre-lit artificial Christmas trees feature a variety of built-in lighting functions designed to create the perfect holiday ambiance. Each tree includes a remote control with dimmer and timer settings, making it easy to customize your lighting experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur warm white pre-lit artificial Christmas trees include functions such as: Steady On, Sequential, Slo-Glo, Chasing\/Flash, Slow Fade, Twinkle, and Combination.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur warm white and multi-color pre-lit trees offer expanded functionality, including: Steady Warm White, Slow Flash Warm White, Slow Fade Warm White, Steady Multicolor, Slow Flash Multicolor, Slow Fade Multicolor, as well as combined warm white and multicolor fading and flashing effects.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur newest addition, the Silverpeak Fir with Warm White and Multi-Color Twinkle Lights, features advanced lighting technology with 10 remote-controlled functions, including: Steady Warm White, Twinkle Warm White, Steady Multicolor, Twinkle Multicolor, Steady Pastel, Fading Warm White to Multicolor, Fast Fading Warm White to Multicolor, Fading Warm White, Fading Multicolor, and Flashing Warm White to Multicolor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eHow do you store a King of Christmas pre-lit tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eProper storage helps preserve both the foliage and the lighting of your pre-lit Christmas tree for many seasons to come. Each King of Christmas tree includes complimentary setup gloves and a complimentary storage bag designed to keep your tree protected between holiday seasons.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhen you are ready to put away your tree, carefully disassemble your tree section by section, loosely folding the branches inward before placing each section into the storage bag. As a reminder, for power pole trees, the only connection that needs to be unplugged is the base cord that plugs into the wall. Store your tree in a cool, dry place away from moisture and extreme temperatures to preserve its foliage, branches, and lights. With proper care, your King of Christmas pre-lit tree will continue to look magical year after year. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you prefer a classic warm white glow or customizable multi-color lighting, King of Christmas pre-lit artificial Christmas trees make it easy to create a beautifully illuminated holiday display. Explore our collection to find a pre-lit Christmas tree that combines convenience, quality, and long-lasting performance for seasons to come.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41965569769672,"sku":"PF-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fa622227-8cc4-441c-b46e-a6f7c09044bd.jpg?v=1714675463"},{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896379968,"sku":"PF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d.jpg?v=1714675448"},{"product_id":"10-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896707648,"sku":"PF-T10-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d_1.jpg?v=1761241980"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897068096,"sku":"QF-T6.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_7831fc2c-0c60-49cb-9368-a7127a8aaa1c.jpg?v=1722012623"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897657920,"sku":"QF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_27cc53c6-965e-42b2-aec7-3712ea7dcff9.jpg?v=1722012616"},{"product_id":"9-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642898804800,"sku":"QF-T9-L","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_570c2957-702c-4393-95f3-99e0455c528e.jpg?v=1722012619"},{"product_id":"10-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1300 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642900377664,"sku":"QF-T10-L","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_8290f7cc-4dda-4d7d-bfbf-bc58b0b18dbc.jpg?v=1722012625"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642901917760,"sku":"KFS-T7.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSli