ur home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642903064640,"sku":"KFS-T12-L","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_3b633f57-a093-4cad-ad9d-b9ee49c0cf07.jpg?v=1714673451"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"9' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642905849920,"sku":"KF-T9-L","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlock_fa57f85a-e2a6-4c97-890c-65a451ccd556.jpg?v=1714673362"},{"product_id":"10-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"10' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1250 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642906243136,"sku":"KF-T10-L","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlock.jpg?v=1714673347"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642909388864,"sku":"YF-T7.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Yorkshire-Fir-v1_04242c5f-9b81-4149-ad07-5298525c13ae.png?v=1722014825"},{"product_id":"6-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-led","title":"6' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree with 450 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":28642909945920,"sku":"KNF-T6-L","price":429.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Noble-Fir-v1_169f3774-d549-4ff3-a309-d3be5e3bcb60.png?v=17146